<h3 dir="ltr" id="we-customer-review-118395" class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line ember-view we-customer-review__title">  Fantastic App for Friends!
</h3>

  <blockquote id="ember27158037" class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive ember-view we-customer-review__body">      

      <p dir=false data-test-bidi>I am a member for olmos 5years I meet there a lot off friends I love to play friendshop I spend most of the time there I create a lot off profile to spend time with friends there but I want to get more help when we need to solve any problem regarding any account..like right now I have an issue with my profiles I can’t send messages to my friends that sad I don’t want to delete my account I love to spend time with friends but if I can’t then please help me with this problem I really appreciate that and I keep enjoying my time there love love</p>

  


